prompt('Try It 4.32','As a mathematical comparison, suppose 100 independent, nonoverlapping 48-hour periods each have probability 0.0143 of the specified moderate-seismic-activity event. Find the probability of exactly five such periods using the binomial distribution and its Poisson approximation. Compare.')
